          {
            "id": "s01",
            "type": "orientation",
            "role": "orientation",
            "skill": "grammar",
            "title_zh": "这节课学什么",
            "body_zh": "把陈述句变成问句，最简单的方法是：如果句子里有 am / is / are，就把它挪到最前面。You are busy → Are you busy?。回答时不用重复整句，用 Yes, I am 这样的简略回答就好。"
          },
          {
            "id": "s02",
            "type": "dialogue",
            "role": "input",
            "skill": "listening",
            "title_en": "Is this seat free?",
            "instructions_zh": "先听。注意问句的开头和简短的回答。",
            "scene_zh": "在培训课的教室里，Lin 想坐到一位陌生人旁边。",
            "lines": [
              {
                "speaker": "Lin",
                "en": "Excuse me, is this seat free?",
                "zh": "打扰一下，这个座位有人吗？"
              },
              {
                "speaker": "Kate",
                "en": "Yes, it is. Sit down.",
                "zh": "没人，坐吧。"
              },
              {
                "speaker": "Lin",
                "en": "Thanks. Are you new here?",
                "zh": "谢谢。你是新来的吗？"
              },
              {
                "speaker": "Kate",
                "en": "No, I'm not. But this class is new for me. Are you a teacher?",
                "zh": "不是。不过这门课对我来说是新的。你是老师吗？"
              },
              {
                "speaker": "Lin",
                "en": "No, I'm not. I'm a student too.",
                "zh": "不是，我也是学生。"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "s03",
            "type": "vocab",
            "role": "input",
            "skill": "vocabulary",
            "instructions_zh": "听一听，跟读问句和回答。",
            "items": [
              "are-you",
              "is-it",
              "yes-i-am",
              "no-im-not"
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "s04",
            "type": "notice",
            "role": "notice",
            "skill": "grammar",
            "question_zh": "陈述句变问句时，be 动词去了哪里？",
            "examples": [
              {
                "en": "You are new. → Are you new?",
                "zh": "你是新来的。→ 你是新来的吗？",
                "highlight": [
                  "Are"
                ]
              },
              {
                "en": "She is a teacher. → Is she a teacher?",
                "zh": "她是老师。→ 她是老师吗？",
                "highlight": [
                  "Is"
                ]
              },
              {
                "en": "This seat is free. → Is this seat free?",
                "zh": "这个座位没人。→ 这个座位没人吗？",
                "highlight": [
                  "Is"
                ]
              }
            ],
            "takeaway_zh": "把 am / is / are 移到主语前面就是问句，句末用问号，语调通常上扬。"
          },
          {
            "id": "s05",
            "type": "choice",
            "role": "guided_practice",
            "skill": "grammar",
            "prompt_zh": "选出正确的问句：",
            "options": [
              "Is she your sister?",
              "She is your sister is?",
